      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"dashboard.json-Description\">Description</h2><p>The dashboard.json contains configurations that allows different display controls to be displayed on the patient dashboard.</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c8c25e25-0a06-4bfa-9daf-09bb05afec58\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Sample dashboard config</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">{\n  &quot;general&quot;: {\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TAB_GENERAL_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;displayByDefault&quot;: true,\n    &quot;maxRecentlyViewedPatients&quot;: 10,\n    &quot;sections&quot;: {},\n\t&quot;printing&quot; :{}\n  },\n  &quot;trends&quot;: {\n    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Trends&quot;,\n    &quot;maxRecentlyViewedPatients&quot;: 10,\n    &quot;sections&quot;: {},\n\t&quot;printing&quot; :{}\n  },\n  &quot;patientSummary&quot;: {\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TAB_PATIENT_SUMMARY_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;maxRecentlyViewedPatients&quot;: 10,\n    &quot;sections&quot;: {},\n\t&quot;printing&quot; :{}\n  }\n}\n</pre>\n</div></div><h3 id=\"dashboard.json-KeyFields\">Key Fields</h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Key</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Info</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Value Type</th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\">translationKey</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Internationalizes the dashboard title. You can provide the key or the title itself.</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Text</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">label</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">If internationalization is not required, then the title of the dashboard can be directly given in label.<br/>Either <em>translationKey</em> or a label is mandatory. </td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Text</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">displayByDefault</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p>True/false. Opens the dashboard tab by default if given as true.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"85c20b25-b114-4bd4-9a2b-22ed99a576bf\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>At least one dashboard should mandatorily have this as <em>true</em>.</p></div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">True/false</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">maxRecentlyViewedPatients</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Configure the number of patients in &quot;recently viewed patients&quot; under the patient switch button</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Number</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">sections</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Any display control can be configured in this section. To configure display controls see <br/><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945573/Display+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945573\" data-linked-resource-version=\"155\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Display Controls</a> </td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">{}</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p>printing</p></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p>This is optional parameter. This can be defined when print functionality is needed<br/><br/></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Key</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Info</th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre><span>title</span></pre></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">name of organisation</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre>header</pre></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">name of document</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre>logo</pre></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">path of hospital logo file</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre>showNameAndImage</pre></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">If set to false, will hide patient name and image on the print page. By default, patient name and image are displayed on the print page</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p><strong>Below keys are considered only when <a href=\"#dashboard.json-QuickPrint\">QuickPrint</a> is enabled </strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre>label</pre></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>name to be displayed on the QuickPrint dropdown.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d0935f81-a3b3-4754-ada2-6cde2e5a4fe1\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><p class=\"title\">Default value when no configuration for label</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>If label is not configured, then <strong>header</strong> is considered</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre>shortcutKey</pre></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>character to be used as keyboard short cut</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p> </p><p> </p><div class=\"expand-container conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"40e4580f-ed31-4e2c-b31d-8cd706d4388d\" data-macro-name=\"expand\" id=\"expander-1500464129\"><div id=\"expander-control-1500464129\" class=\"expand-control\"><span class=\"expand-control-icon icon\"> </span><span class=\"expand-control-text\">Sample configuration for printing </span></div><div id=\"expander-content-1500464129\" class=\"expand-content expand-hidden\"><pre>&quot;printing&quot;: {\n           &quot;title&quot;: &quot;ABC Hospital&quot;,\n           &quot;header&quot;: &quot;General Report&quot;,\n           &quot;logo&quot;: &quot;../images/bahmniLogo.png&quot;,</pre><pre>\t\t\t&quot;showNameAndImage&quot;: true,</pre><pre>\t\t   &quot;label&quot;: &quot;General&quot;</pre><pre>           &quot;shortcutKey&quot;:&quot;g&quot;\n       }</pre></div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>{}</p><p> </p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id=\"dashboard.json-AddingPrintingCapabilitytoPatientDashboard\">Adding Printing Capability to Patient Dashboard</h2><p>One can add a <em>Print</em> button on any of the dashboard <em>tabs. </em> For instance, see below, Print button has been added to two of the tabs (by adding the <em>printing</em> element to the json). </p><p> </p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"188c74c5-0e82-4477-9a6e-99e868759beb\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Sample dashboard config</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">{\n  &quot;general&quot;: {\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TAB_GENERAL_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;displayByDefault&quot;: true,\n    &quot;maxRecentlyViewedPatients&quot;: 10,\n    &quot;printing&quot;: {\n           &quot;title&quot;: &quot;ABC Hospital&quot;,\n           &quot;header&quot;: &quot;General Report&quot;,\n           &quot;logo&quot;: &quot;../images/bahmniLogo.png&quot;,\n\t\t   &quot;showNameAndImage&quot;: true\n       },\n    &quot;sections&quot;: {}\n  },\n  &quot;trends&quot;: {\n    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Trends&quot;,\n    &quot;maxRecentlyViewedPatients&quot;: 10,\n    &quot;sections&quot;: {}\n  },\n  &quot;patientSummary&quot;: {\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TAB_PATIENT_SUMMARY_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;maxRecentlyViewedPatients&quot;: 10,\n    &quot;printing&quot;: {\n           &quot;title&quot;: &quot;ABC Hospital&quot;,\n           &quot;header&quot;: &quot;Summary Report&quot;,\n           &quot;logo&quot;: &quot;../images/bahmniLogo.png&quot;,\n\t\t   &quot;showNameAndImage&quot;: false\n       },\n    &quot;sections&quot;: {}\n  }\n}\n</pre>\n</div></div><p> </p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" alt=\"Dashboard with Print key\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/Print%20Key.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1465917450489&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=997&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945569/Print%20Key.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1465917450489&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"66912380\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Print Key.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945569\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"34\" data-media-id=\"2ff63129-31de-4456-bf51-7fbe245570e4\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Dashboard with Print key\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/Print%20Key.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1465917450489&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1994&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/Print%20Key.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1465917450489&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=997&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><p> </p><p> </p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" alt=\"Print Dashboard Preview\" height=\"1140\" width=\"968\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/Print%20Preview.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1465917544504&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=968&amp;height=1140\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945569/Print%20Preview.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1465917544504&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"66912382\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Print Preview.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945569\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"34\" data-media-id=\"a49589f9-d2b6-4751-9008-2f3b079266af\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Print Dashboard Preview\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/Print%20Preview.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1465917544504&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=968&amp;height=1140 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/Print%20Preview.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1465917544504&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=968&amp;height=1140 1x\"></span></p><h2 id=\"dashboard.json-Hidingpatientnameandimage\">Hiding patient name and image </h2><p>If &quot;showNameAndImage&quot; is set to false, the patient name and image are hidden on the print page as below.</p><h2 id=\"dashboard.json-\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"250\" width=\"874\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/Screen%20Shot%202016-08-23%20at%204.41.32%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1471950799588&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=874&amp;height=249\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945569/Screen%20Shot%202016-08-23%20at%204.41.32%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1471950799588&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"81592533\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-08-23 at 4.41.32 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945569\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"34\" data-media-id=\"ea4cfa43-4cfd-418a-b0c7-76d0f25bede6\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/Screen%20Shot%202016-08-23%20at%204.41.32%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1471950799588&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1147&amp;height=328 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/Screen%20Shot%202016-08-23%20at%204.41.32%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1471950799588&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=874&amp;height=249 1x\"></span></h2><h2 id=\"dashboard.json-QuickPrint\">Quick Print</h2><p>Quick Prints will give the ability to print any dashboard / tab (either patient dashboard / tab or visit dashboard / tab) from patient dashboard. This functionality is extension to the normal print behaviour where one can print the page one is currently on.To enable quick prints, the configuration should be added in clinical, app.json. The default behaviour is to print the tab or page one is landed i.e.., page one has clicked print from. If quick prints is enabled, then one can choose to print any patient dashboard (if configured multiple) and any visit dashboard (if configured one or many).</p><p> <span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" alt=\"Quick Print\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/printing_option_at_hedder.jpg?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1469629983729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=457&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945569/printing_option_at_hedder.jpg?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1469629983729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"75694130\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"printing_option_at_hedder.jpg\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945569\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"34\" data-media-id=\"c0afc2cf-a2ce-4fa0-a453-dacfe57619a2\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Quick Print\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/printing_option_at_hedder.jpg?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1469629983729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=914&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945569/printing_option_at_hedder.jpg?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1469629983729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=457&amp;height=250 1x\"></span> </p><p>To enable quick print functionality, follow these steps</p><ol><li>Go to <em>bahmni-config</em> (an implementation-specific configuration folder). The settings are available at <em>bahmni-config/openmrs/apps/clinical/app.json</em>.</li><li><span>Add the following piece of configuration in the 'config' section of the file.</span></li></ol><p><span><span><strong>Configuration to enable quick print</strong></span></span></p><div><div class=\"syntaxhighlighter sh-confluence nogutter js\"><p> </p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b1694c38-6900-44e2-8208-38ace846aa65\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Enable Quick Print</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;quickPrints&quot;: true</pre>\n</div></div><h2 id=\"dashboard.json-AddingPatientAttributestoPatientDashboard\"> Adding Patient Attributes to Patient Dashboard</h2><p>One can add below configuration on any of the dashboard <em>tabs </em>under <em>sections</em> category. And this shows patient's age only in years on patient dashboard.</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7dc9d866-db08-46f9-8e34-055868c98749\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">    &quot;general&quot;:{  \n        &quot;translationKey&quot;:&quot;DASHBOARD_TAB_GENERAL_KEY&quot;,\n        &quot;displayByDefault&quot;:true, \n        &quot;maxRecentlyViewedPatients&quot;:10,\n        &quot;sections&quot;:{  \n            &quot;patientInformation&quot;:{  \n                &quot;translationKey&quot;:&quot;DASHBOARD_TITLE_PATIENT_INFORMATION_KEY&quot;,\n                &quot;type&quot;:&quot;patientInformation&quot;,\n                &quot;displayOrder&quot;:0,\n                &quot;ageLimit&quot;:23\n             }\n        }\n      }   </pre>\n</div></div><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945569/Screen%20Shot%202017-03-30%20at%204.13.22%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490870644520&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945569/Screen%20Shot%202017-03-30%20at%204.13.22%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490870644520&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115812767\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-03-30 at 4.13.22 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945569\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"34\" data-media-id=\"25513f9d-a203-4e80-99d2-00d95fa99584\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span></p><p> </p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d3fff348-98ab-4761-b8ba-b60e2e5eb30b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #FFFBD0;\"><b>On this page</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"8d0510ad-2ad6-4ac5-80c4-4b3012e21c5a\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ed9c5ae9-ee7d-4425-9c32-5cd906945326\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #59C4C5;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945573/Display+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945573\" data-linked-resource-version=\"155\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">All Display Controls (Full Index)</a></p><p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37355639/Patient+Dashboard\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37355639\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Patient Dashboard</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
